msgstr "Funcionalidades"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:389
msgid "Abandoned Cart Recovery"
msgstr "Recuperação de Carrinhos Abandonados"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:390
msgid ""
"Automatically recover lost sales with targeted emails to customers who left "
"items in their cart."
msgstr ""
"Recupere automaticamente vendas perdidas com e-mails direcionados para clientes "
"que deixaram itens no carrinho."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:404
msgid "Transactional Emails"
msgstr "E-mails Transacionais"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:405
msgid ""
"Replace default WooCommerce emails with beautiful MandrakeCRM templates: New "
"Account, Processing, On Hold, Completed, Customer Note, Refunded, Cancelled, "
"Failed, and Password Reset."
msgstr ""
"Substitua os e-mails padrão do WooCommerce por lindos templates do MandrakeCRM: "
"Nova Conta, Processando, Em Espera, Concluído, Nota ao Cliente, Reembolsado, "
"Cancelado, Falhou e Redefinir Senha."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:420
msgid "Smart Lead Capture Popup"
msgstr "Popup Inteligente de Captura de Leads"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:421
msgid ""
"Convert visitors into customers with exit-intent popups that build your "
"email list and nurture relationships."
msgstr ""
"Converta visitantes em clientes com popups de intenção de saída que constroem "
"a sua lista de e-mails e nutrem relacionamentos."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:436
msgid "Checkout Marketing Consent"
msgstr "Consentimento de Marketing no Checkout"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:437
msgid ""
"Grow your subscriber list by collecting marketing consent during checkout."
msgstr ""
"Aumente a sua lista de assinantes coletando consentimento de marketing durante o "
"checkout."

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:439
#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:447
msgid "Always On"
msgstr "Sempre Ativo"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:444
msgid "Marketing Attribution Tracking"
msgstr "Rastreamento de Atribuição de Marketing"

#: includes/class-mandrakecrm-admin.php:445
msgid ""
"Track UTM parameters to measure campaign ROI and attribute sales to your "
"MandrakeCRM campaigns."
msgstr ""
"Rastreie parâmetros UTM para medir o ROI de campanhas e atribuir vendas às suas "
"campanhas do MandrakeCRM."

